{
  "id": "ECC.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Nomeji 2",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndūhū ngofyoolo ū mu kūyegela ya sī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna niwīla, “Ī gete nageme ū kwīyegela ī ya mu sī; haho lūūlū, yegaga”. Alīyo nū ng'wenūmo nūbona ndūhū mo ī ngofyoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūhaya, “Ū kwisekeleja gūlī mhayo gwa nyabbūūlī; ī gīsī ū mu kūyega shilīmo kī ī sha kūsola?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūgema kūyūgūzalabanya ū mīlī gone mu nzīla ya kūng'wa walwa, kūnū nū būbbūūlī nataalī nadimanile nabo, na a maganiko gane gataalī gakūnitongeelaga mu masala. Naalī na ng'hūmbū ja kwīmana īyo ībigelile kwīyīta a banhū aho bataalī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū, ū mu shikū ī ngehu ī ja būlamu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakīīta milīmo mitaale, nizengela manumba na kūlīma migūnda ya mizabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibeegeja migūnda misoga mitaale na mido, nūhamba mo mitī ya matwajo ya būlī mbika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūsīmba na nzwinzī jane nene ng'wenekīlī, ja kūyūdaha a minzī nalitīīla ī lipoolu lya mitī ūlū īlīkūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūgūla na basese bagosha na bakīma, na a basese ba kūbyalīlwa ha ng'wane nabo būkwīla no. Hama a madaale ga ng'holo nī ng'ombe ayo naalī nago gaalī mataale kūbaheeba pye a banhū abo baalī mu Yelusalemu aho nataalī ū nene ū kūbiza ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūsoleleja feza na zahabu ningī no, na sabo jingī na jingī ja kūfuma kū batemi ba sī nhaale na ndo. Nūpandīka na bīmbi bingī, bagosha na bakīma; na bakīma bingī nūbilingīja kūlwa kwiyeja gīt'ūmo īdūgije kūyegela ng'holò ya ngosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūhangama kīngī nasho, nūbiza ntaale kūbaheeba pye abo baalīho ū mu Yelusalemu aho nataalī ū nene ū kūbiza ho. Ū mu yose yīnīyī, ū witegeleja bone naalī na taalī nabo dūhū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ū wa masala nū mbūūlī bakachaaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūminyiwa milīmo kūtī na ngofyoolo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho lūūlū nūbūkolwa no ū būpanga, nguno īyo īkīītagwa a ha sīlīlī ya līīmi, ū kūlī nene īlī ya kūpīnīhaja no; pyī ūmo īgelelile ītī na ngofyoolo, nguno īlī ya kūpeeja lūyaga dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī milīmo yane īyo yaninoja kwīyīta a ha sīlīlī ya līīmi nūyīdalaha no, nguno nakabona gīkī shinigeleelilwe kūnekela munhū ūyo alize ha numa yane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī nani ūyo amanile ūlū akūbiza wa masala, nūūlū mbūūlī? Alīyo nahene hū ng'wene akūbiza ntaale wayo ī milīmo yenīyo, īyo nīnoga nogela nene, nakūtūmamīlaga masala gane ha sīlīlī ya līīmi. Ū gwenūyū nago gūtī na ngofyoolo gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūkaniminya no, gūnigwisha ng'holò ū kū milīmo yane pyī īyo yaninojaga nakwītūmamaga ha sīlīlī ya līīmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū munhū nūūlū akaminyīka akwītaga milīmo na masala, na witegeleja hamò na būgoogo būtaale, alīyo nahene pyī ī shikolo shakwe shiigelile anekele munhū ūngī, ūyo atashinogelile. Ū gwenūyū hū gwa sagala gete, hama mi no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū akūpandīka solobo kī lūūlū ū kūfuma ū mu milīmo nū būnoge bokwe ūbo akūnoga nogaga a ha sīlīlī ya līīlmi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pyī ī shikū jakwe ī milīmo yakwe ya kūsedeecha na kūsaatya mīlī; nū būjikū a maganiko gakwe gatifuulaga yaya; nū gwenūyū nago gūtī na ngofyoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūlī munhū gūtīho mhayo gwawiza gītī kūlya na kūng'wa na kūshiyegela īsho akūshinoga nogelaga. Alīyo nago ū gwenūyū naagūbonile gīkī gūfumile mu nkono go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūlū atī wei nani ūyo adūgije kūlya na kūng'wa na kūyega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu akang'winhaga masala, witegeleja, na būyegi ū munhū ūyo akīītaga ya kūnyeja we, alīyo ū ng'hūnga, akang'winhaga milīmo ya kūbilingīja na kashilūndīka, alanekele ū munhū ūyo anyegije Mulungu. Ū gwenūyū nago gūtī na ngofyoolo, gūlī gītī kūpeeja lūyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
